        book_now = {
            "How goes {book}? Tell me a little. I like a story told under a tree.",
            "{book} is waiting the way a tree waits: patiently, and in the same spot.",
            "Who in {book} is the oldest? I always want to know what the old ones think.",
            "I wonder how {book} begins and ends. Middles I can guess. Middles are always growing.",
            "{book}, still open at your page. Shall we see what the next leaf says?",
            "Has {book} surprised you yet? At my age surprises are rare and precious.",
            "Read me a passage of {book} some evening. I have listened to many readers. I would like to hear yours.",
